    If you want a second pair of eyes on your subject combination, money runway and family expectations, explore
    <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/career-guidance-after-bsc/">career guidance after BSc</a>, which gives ongoing support instead of a one-time chat.
    You can also try our <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/assessments">career and skill assessments</a> to see which work style suits you.
  </p>

